  "description": "High-density, zero-backend OKLCH colorimetric engineering studio & design token engine. 100% client-side with APCA 0.98G / WCAG 2.1 matrix, 2D chromaticity gamut plotter, cubic Bézier lightness easing, and multi-format token export.",
